From 1831d5fe330e9cd7de068151cafaa9b401402500 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Corey Delizza <coreydelizza@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 22:39:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Capture the full data inventory in the data-integrity
 module
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Expands the admin Signal & Noise module from 3 stages to 5, surfacing every
data point the current app structure exposes — all computed live from the
source datasets through the adapters seam, no new instrumentation.

New engines (pure, dependency-free):
- src/data/metrics.ts — 67 derived metrics across 9 domains (time & cost,
  meeting quality, decision health, outcome validation, attendee truth,
  relationship/cross-org, delegation & agents, dependencies & risks,
  ledger/flow), each with its source field.
- src/data/gaps.ts — the five reconciliation gaps (claimed vs measured, host
  vs attendee/false-closure, coverable vs authorized delegation, declared value
  vs realized outcome, recommended state vs live calendar), each flagged.

New/updated screens & stages (View · Metrics · Gaps · Reconciliation · Catalog):
- Metrics, Gaps screens.
- Catalog (was "Raw data") expanded to browse every dataset: scorecards,
  decisions, actions, dependencies, risks, agents + authorizations, closeout,
  attendee signals, receipts ledger, org cards.
- adapters.ts extended with getters for all datasets — still the one seam.

Gating unchanged: all admin code stays behind __ADMIN_TOOLS__ and is compiled
out of the public build (verified: public bundle unchanged at 292 KB, admin
342 KB; admin-only strings absent from dist/).

Verified: tsc clean; both builds green; all screens render; no runtime errors.

